invariant: INV-44
file: p384_wide_verify.c
catches: p384_equiv_test
reason: the host verifier compares the sum's x with s, so no signature
  verifies. bin/p384_equiv_test requires p384.c's verdict, and 1, on
  the signatures it builds.

--- old
    return p384_wide_point_x_is_r(&sum, r);
--- new
    return p384_wide_point_x_is_r(&sum, s);
